    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GCS: Salvage Rat</strong> is a gritty, first-person space sim with permadeath and immersive salvage contracts. Explore a procedurally generated universe of hostile factions, dangerous asteroid fields, and derelict stations. Pilot a fully customizable ship, mine valuable resources, fight for control, and descend into abandoned hulks on foot in tense FPS missions. There are no second chances \u2014 your legacy is all that remains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're hunting bounties, stripping wrecks for data, or trading across star systems, every decision matters in this brutal, single-player sci-fi experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd27 <strong>Dual Gameplay Modes</strong><br>Pilot your spacecraft in full first-person, then breach derelict stations or contract sites in immersive FPS missions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0c <strong>Massive Procedural Universe</strong><br>Explore up to potentially 1,000+ hand-seeded star systems, each procedurally generated with dynamic NPCs and salvage contracts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699\ufe0f <strong>Hardpoint-Based Ship Customization</strong><br>Equip mining lasers, turrets, armor plating, missile bays, and utility modules to tailor your craft to your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 <strong>True Permadeath</strong><br>Death is final. But achievements, rank, and exploits live on in the game\u2019s legacy records.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Economy &amp; Faction Warfare</strong><br>Trade across stations, accept high-risk salvage jobs, and navigate a web of procedurally generated NPC factions under seven major alliances.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83d\ude80 <strong>No Waiting. No Matchmaking. Just Play.</strong><br><strong>GCS: Salvage Rat</strong> is designed from the ground up for solo players who want immediate, high-stakes gameplay \u2014 with no dependency on others.</p></li></ul>",
